    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 29 October 2001 the erection of a single storey rear extension at a height of 2.87m, depth of 3.29m from the main dwellinghouse and at a width of 4.45m and rear conservatory at a height of 2.74m, depth of 2.5m and width of 4.35; would have been lawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reasons; \r\nThe proposed development would fall within Class A Part 1 Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning Order 1995.\r\nInformative B: Planning Permission is therefore not required."
